 AltarSMP-Custom-Content/packs/pack.zip     | Bin 301373 -> 304106 bytes
 tools/crossplay/render.py                  |  28 ++++++++++----
 tools/crossplay/validate_custom_content.py |  43 ++++++++++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 59 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

